EXACT_TYPE_PASS:SingularClosure.CRITICAL_ROUGH_TRANSPORT_ENERGY_BOUND
CRITICAL_ROUGH_TRANSPORT_ENERGY_BOUND : ∃ C,
  0 < C ∧
    ∀ (ν : ℝ),
      0 < ν →
        ∀ (u v : Field) (G : Vec → Vec →L[ℝ] Vec),
          MemLp u 6 (volume.restrict unitCube) →
            CriticalPhysicalH1 v G →
              |criticalRoughTransport v G u| ≤
                ν / 2 * criticalGradientEnergy G +
                  (216 * C ^ 4 * criticalSpatialNorm 6 u ^ 4 / ν ^ 3 + 3 * C ^ 2 * criticalSpatialNorm 6 u ^ 2 / ν) *
                    physicalEnergy v
'SingularClosure.CRITICAL_ROUGH_TRANSPORT_ENERGY_BOUND' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
